[E0425] Error: `Db` is a C type whose contents are not known
    ╭─[ err/115_pointers/main.wip:14:9 ]
    │
 14 │     db: Db                          // no value of a C type exists
    │         ─┬  
    │          ╰── not a type a value can have
    │ 
    │ Help: a pointer to one is written `ptr<Db>`
